  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and beetroot into small chunks.\n• Cut brown onion into wedges. Thinly slice capsicum.\n• Divide veggies, garlic & herb seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper between two lined oven trays.\n• Toss to coat, spread in a single layer then roast until tender, 25-30 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459c1748b7cf792505b4a/step-b7b8c800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm slices.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil and garlic in a medium frying pan over medium-high heat, until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer garlic oil to a small heatproof bowl. Stir in Greek-style yoghurt (see ingredients). Season to taste. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459c1748b7cf792505b4a/step-7a08e010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2-4 mins each side. Remove pan from heat, add the honey and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459c1748b7cf792505b4a/step-52b6f820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine balsamic vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil. Add roasted veggies and mixed salad leaves to dressing and toss to combine.\n• Divide roast veggie toss between bowls. Top with haloumi and garlic yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a5459c1748b7cf792505b4a/step-04407730.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
